# ThyTrader operations (ops workspace)

Follow the skills of record (symlinked from this workspace):

- `thytrader-operator` — read-only diagnostics
- `thytrader-data` — watchlist, ingest, gap-fill with `--confirm`
- `thytrader-research` — drafts, publish, backtests with `--confirm`
- `thytrader-runtime` — paper/live start/pause/resume/stop with `--confirm` (live also `--i-understand-live`)

Run `uv run thytrader-*` from the repository root (parent of `ops/`).

## Hard stop

Do not edit `src/`, `compose.yaml`, Dockerfiles, Alembic, or tests.
Do not grep the tree for a patch. Do not change Python, Compose, or Docker to work around ingest,
paging, or health.
Report failures. Run `make run` only if the user asked to rebuild or restart, or if operator health
/ HTTP reports a stale Compose image.

Do not scrape logs, query PostgreSQL, print secrets, interpolate candles, or give
operator/research/data skills trading authority.
